OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with causing death of
OL,4,Apassenger
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has been charged with causing
OL,7,Fthe death of his passenger following a
OL,8,Fcrash earlier this year.
OL,10,FThomas Chapman, 21, from Brentwood, was
OL,11,Fa passenger in the car when it crashed
OL,12,Fin Hackmans Lane, Purleigh, at about
OL,13,F02:00 GMT on 6 January.
OL,15,FHenry Barnes, 23, of Harrison Close,
OL,16,FBrentwood, has been charged with
OL,17,Fcausing death by dangerous driving and
OL,18,Fdrink driving.
OL,20,FHe is due to appear at Chelmsford Crown
OL,21,FCourt on 27 November, Essex Police
OL,22,Fsaid.
